@startuml
title <size:24>Container View: K8sManager</size>\n<size:24>Thirteen bounded-context containers plus their adapter layer. Domain cores never import infrastructure (ADR-0011, ADR-0020). Every external system is reached via a dedicated adapter implementing a domain port.</size>

set separator none
top to bottom direction
skinparam ranksep 20
skinparam nodesep 5
hide stereotype

